      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>For Q1 2026, the $78,303 beginning balance as of 12/31/25 was moved to its own line, in the 2025 FERC Form 1, this balance was included in "Other Regulatory Assets Under $100,000".</p>
      </div>
